      "title": "Lesson Goals",
      "items": [
        "Use 'seguir + gerundio' to mean 'to still be doing something' (Sigo viviendo aquí).",
        "Use 'seguir sin + infinitivo' to mean 'still not doing something' (Sigo sin entender)."
      ]
